# Admin

## Surfaces

- `apps/admin` is the **operator console** (Next.js). It is not the marketing
  site and not the mobile app.
- `apps/web` stays Astro. Do not move marketing pages to Next.
- Member tokens never authorize admin routes. Admin tokens never authorize
  member routes.

## Identity

Operators live in `AdminUser` / `admin_*` Better Auth tables, not `User`.
Roles are additive: `content`, `support`, `superadmin`. Superadmin implies
every product permission and is the only role that manages operators.

## API

Admin procedures live in `adminContract` (`packages/contract`). Implement them
under `apps/api/src/modules/admin/`. Fail closed on role checks.

Content: catalog, tips, waitlist. Support: member list and lookup (outcome +
points only — no vitals/glucose payloads), ledger adjustments, member deactivate.
Support mutations write `AdminAuditEvent` and, for points, an append-only
ledger row.
